{"unit_id":"King20260919__dsh-open-folder-visible#card-zh","repo":"King20260919/dsh-open-folder-visible","commit":"00def00620d630f65979305ff045949a5bd1cdfd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-folder-visible 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Windows 工作目录打开修复插件。它在 Host 注册目录打开路由，并在浏览器端将仅针对 Explorer 的工作目录请求改道到该路由。插件通过不隐藏 Explorer 窗口的方式打开会话工作目录，同时保留原有按钮、菜单和快捷键。路由会检查请求格式、目录路径及平台，并报告启动结果。适合在 Windows 上使用 DSH Web、点击打开工作目录却看不到资源管理器窗口的用户。需要 Windows 主机及 explorer.exe；无需 API 密钥或额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:142-229","client.js:48-79","cordis.patch.yml:21-23"]}
{"unit_id":"King20260919__dsh-open-folder-visible#card-en","repo":"King20260919/dsh-open-folder-visible","commit":"00def00620d630f65979305ff045949a5bd1cdfd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-open-folder-visible fixes invisible DSH workspace windows on Windows. It reroutes the Explorer folder request to a host route that opens the directory visibly, while preserving the existing button and shortcut. Requires Windows and explorer.exe; no API key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:142-229","client.js:48-79","cordis.patch.yml:21-23"]}
