{"unit_id":"King20260919__dsh-open-folder-visible#feature-1","repo":"King20260919/dsh-open-folder-visible","commit":"00def00620d630f65979305ff045949a5bd1cdfd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-folder-visible 的功能「可见地打开工作目录」：Host 路由用 explorer.exe 打开经过验证的绝对目录，并关闭隐藏窗口选项。用户触发 DSH 会话的打开工作目录动作后，可看到资源管理器窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:191-218","index.js:127-134"]}
{"unit_id":"King20260919__dsh-open-folder-visible#feature-2","repo":"King20260919/dsh-open-folder-visible","commit":"00def00620d630f65979305ff045949a5bd1cdfd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-folder-visible 的功能「只改道 Explorer 请求」：浏览器端包装 fetch，仅当 POST 请求路径和请求体都指向 Explorer 时，才将目录请求发送到插件路由；其他请求继续调用原 fetch。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:53-72"]}
{"unit_id":"King20260919__dsh-open-folder-visible#feature-3","repo":"King20260919/dsh-open-folder-visible","commit":"00def00620d630f65979305ff045949a5bd1cdfd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-folder-visible 的功能「检查打开请求」：路由要求 JSON 请求体包含字符串路径，确认路径为绝对路径且指向现存目录；无效请求会返回对应错误状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:158-209"]}
{"unit_id":"King20260919__dsh-open-folder-visible#caveat-1","repo":"King20260919/dsh-open-folder-visible","commit":"00def00620d630f65979305ff045949a5bd1cdfd","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-folder-visible 使用前须知：仅 Windows 支持实际启动 Explorer；其他平台的路由返回 501，且该插件只覆盖打开工作目录的动作。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:211-216","README.md:79-88"]}
